   "notes": [
    "Half-Orc Crit Smiter: Paladin 5 (Vengeance) / Warlock 5 (Hexblade) / Fighter 2, Balduran's Giantslayer with Cloud Giant Strength (27, doubled on hits), The Dead Shot in the ranged slot and Sarevok's Horned Helmet for crits on 17-20 with Hexblade's Curse, Divine Smite saved for crits",
    "Agonising Blaster: Sorcerer 6 / Warlock 2 / Fighter 4, Charisma 24, Spell Sniper (crits on 19-20), Eldritch Blast with Haste, Action Surge and Quickened casts (sorcery points from Font of Magic), Elixir of Battlemage's Power. Potent Robe adds Charisma to each beam; Spellmight's -5 for +1d8 is worth turning on; Rhapsody (+3 to hit and damage on each beam after three kills) and the Callous Glow Ring (+2 radiant on lit targets) are its best extras",
    "Throwzerker: Giant Barbarian 12 with Tavern Brawler, throwing Nyrulna",
    "Other gear picked by the gear solver for damage, one build at a time so no unique item is shared",
    "Fire Sorcerer: Draconic Bloodline (red) Sorcerer 12, Scorching Ray upcast with every slot (5 rays on average) and Quickened, Fire Bolt with the Haste action. Spellmight's -5 for +1d8 a ray is its biggest gear gain; Hat of Fire Acuity's Arcane Acuity is counted as about +5 to spell attacks"
